WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
You shipped the work. Then came the questions.

00:03.200 --> 00:06.100
Where is that setting? What happens next?

00:06.100 --> 00:10.500
Meet Handover. Record once. Keep the whole story.

00:10.500 --> 00:16.400
Capture a screen video with your microphone, or use the browser recorder for searchable page actions.

00:16.400 --> 00:19.750
Replay the flow and follow each step.

00:19.750 --> 00:23.500
Add a timestamp note, so the next person knows what matters.

00:23.500 --> 00:25.700
Skip the parts they do not need.

00:25.700 --> 00:30.200
Review captured text and choose what to redact before sharing.

00:30.200 --> 00:32.700
Keep related recordings in a project.

00:32.700 --> 00:37.300
Build a private guide with clear sections, recordings, and useful links.

00:37.300 --> 00:42.100
Looking for an earlier walkthrough? Search by title and open the right recording.

00:42.100 --> 00:44.250
Your recordings start private.

00:44.250 --> 00:46.400
Create a viewer link when you are ready.

00:46.400 --> 00:49.000
Copy the link or embed the recording.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.800
Revoke access when the handover changes.

00:51.800 --> 00:57.000
Handover. Record once. Keep the whole story.
